# LF everywhere, always (Windows host, Linux containers). Commit #1 by design.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.go text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
# A TTF is a font too: web/static/fonts/spline-sans-mono.ttf is the face the poster label is
# drawn with (DESIGN.md §20 erratum 287). `text=auto` would guess, and a guess that goes the
# wrong way rewrites CRLF inside a binary table.
*.ttf binary
